		{
			"rank": 200.0,
			"source": "check A1",
			"text": "Commander think tick median = 0.631 ms over 128 ticks (step scout). The worst step is `scout` in commander.gd `_think()`: cap its work per tick (a budget in usec, continue next tick), cache its group scans (AIWorldCache, ai-2v2.md:336), and move one-time setup / resource loads out of the first ticks. Commander counters: rule_usec_max / rule_usec_max_at say when it spiked.",
			"title": "Split the Commander's worst think step"
		},
		{
			"rank": 101.9257,
			"source": "hot list: `scripts/ui/command_card.gd`",
			"text": "1.926 ms / frame over 1 nodes. `scripts/ui/command_card.gd`: refresh labels / bars on signals or at 4-10 Hz instead of every _process, and only set text when it changed.",
			"title": "HUD refresh"
		},
		{
			"rank": 98.404,
			"source": "hot list: `scripts/units/unit.gd`",
			"text": "0.404 ms / frame over 14 nodes. shader parameter write (unit.gd:1948 in `_update_hp_bar()`, unit.gd:1949 in `_update_hp_bar()`). Fix: write only when the value changes (compare first) or move the animation into the shader (TIME). `scripts/units/unit.gd` `_physics_process`: run target acquisition / aggro scans every 0.2-0.3 s with a per-unit offset instead of every frame, use a spatial hash for nearest-enemy, and skip idle units.",
			"title": "Cheaper unit ticks"
		},
		{
			"rank": 96.3678,
			"source": "hot list: `scripts/vfx/capture_rings.gd`",
			"text": "0.368 ms / frame over 1 nodes. allocation (.new()) (capture_rings.gd:284 in `_add_ring()`, capture_rings.gd:287 in `_add_ring()`, capture_rings.gd:289 in `_add_ring()`). Fix: pool the object / node, or reuse a member instead of allocating per frame. `scripts/vfx/capture_rings.gd`: keep effects pooled (pre-built, restarted) and let idle pools stop processing (set_process(false) while nothing plays).",
			"title": "VFX manager"
		},
